{"2930290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Love at The Milky Way Diner", "steam_appid": 2930290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Love at the Milky Way Diner&quot; is in early access! </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story has been sprit into three chapters, with chapter 1 out now! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Chapter 1 includes....</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 80k words of dialogue, not including our first demo day.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 130 discoverable recipes to cook for your customers</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>17 character CGS ( 8 from the demo + 9 new)</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">-Story-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200 years after first contact, humanity is still trying to find their  place in a galaxy full of far more advanced and established species.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One such human, our protagonist, has recently been laid off from their corporate job on Mars when news reaches them; their distant aunt Cassiopia has passed away suddenly, and she would like one of her relatives to take over her restaurant on the distant deep space station Hesperides. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist decides to take a leap of faith. They may have never left their home start system of Helios, but surely there must be something (or maybe someone) better out there waiting for them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When they reach the station they find themselves welcomed by a vibrant, multi-species community of eccentric individuals who are only too happy to welcome the new owner of their favourite place to eat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">-Gameplay-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In &quot;Love at the Milky Way Diner&quot; your choices affect the story! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Talk to your fellow residents, serve them a nice warm meal, and maybe even win their hearts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A relaxing and cozy, lo-fi inspired soundtrack by the lovely Opal Voss </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 50+ recipes to discover and cook for your customers </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 dateable characters and over 20 unlockable character CGS </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A branching story in which you will experience your first month of life on the deep space station Hesperides </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">-Dateables-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Love at the Milky Way Diner will feature 8 love interests, each with their own routes and stories</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930290/extras/e7d07128597497e83a9957a465443c16.avif?t=1765485026\" width=1200 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930290/extras/795b652d34dad6d8b8220d6d7247fcba.avif?t=1765485026\" width=1200 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930290/extras/f226ac6b4d7b2b437f25e28f725b1b96.avif?t=1765485026\" width=1200 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co